# Re-include manuscript/print/ (numbers.csv, ngl_links.csv, supplemental
# data, neuroglancer_states, etc.), manuscript/abstracts/ (conference
# abstracts), and manuscript/scripts/ (paper-orchestration helpers like
# regenerate_paper.sh, fix_ai_paths.py) so they can be tracked. Keep the
# figure-asset subdirectories under manuscript/print/ ignored — those
# are rebuilt by figure scripts and would bloat history. Confidential
# subdirs (biorxiv, resubmission_1, resubmission_2 — cover letters,
# response-to-referees, reporting summaries) stay excluded.
!manuscript/print/
!manuscript/abstracts/
!manuscript/scripts/
manuscript/print/figure*/
dataverse/*
*banc_meta.csv

